<title>USA: TABLE-Biomet Inc Q4 May 31 net rises.</title>
<headline>TABLE-Biomet Inc Q4 May 31 net rises.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW, Ind. 1997-07-02</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pct</p>
<p>					 1997	    1998	 Change</p>
<p> Net sales			$152,996	$141,417	  8 %</p>
<p> Gross profit		    104,893	  95,755	   10</p>
<p> Operating income		 42,959	  37,990	   13</p>
<p> Net income			 28,903     27,129(a)	    7</p>
<p> Earnings per share		  .26	  .24(a)	    8</p>
<p> U.S. sales			111,116	 101,232	 10 %</p>
<p> Foreign sales		    41,880	  40,185	    4</p>
<p> Reconstructive sales	   94,634	  88,763	  7 %</p>
<p> EBI sales			  29,001	  27,617	    5</p>
<p> Other products		   29,361	  25,037	   17</p>
<p>Year</p>
<p> Net sales			 580,347	 535,159	  8 %</p>
<p> Gross profit		    394,552	 360,795	    9</p>
<p> Operating income		159,811	 137,280	   16</p>
<p> Net income			106,454     94,106(a)	   13</p>
<p> Earnings per share		  .94	  .82(a)	   15</p>
<p> U.S. sales			425,522	 396,707	  7 %</p>
<p> Foreign sales		   154,825	 138,452	   12</p>
