<p> EBI sales			 114,321	 108,627	    5</p>
<p> Other products		  113,904	  99,698	   14</p>
<p>			 (000's Except Per Share Data)</p>
<p>(a) Year-ago results include $1.7 million or $0.015 per share in net income as a result of one-time payment from United States Surgical Corp (USSC) related to termination of a joint venture agreement between Biomet and USSC.</p>
<p>((--Chicago Newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
